           Cell["After the amplitudes above complete, run this export. One \
C++ process contains the helicity family. It builds SPINAS and compares the \
squared amplitudes with CalcHEP and MadGraph at 1000 phase-space points each. \
The complete reports and random seeds remain in the Export variable.",
            "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5WpWmhhhExport = \
WriteSPINASProcess[\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \"WpWmhhh\"}],\n  \
{\"W+\", \"W-\"} -> {\"h\", \"h\", \"h\"},\n  {\n    {sm5WpWmhhhParticles, \
sm5WpWmhhhAmplitude}\n  }, sm,\n  \"ProcessName\" -> \"sm5WpWmhhh\", Sequence \
@@ validationOptions];\nIf[AssociationQ[sm5WpWmhhhExport], \
sm5WpWmhhhExport[\"Directory\"], sm5WpWmhhhExport]", "Input", CellTags ->
                "sm5-export-sm5f_b80ee23ca123"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[
