           Cell["After the amplitudes above complete, run this export. One \
C++ process contains the helicity family. It builds SPINAS and compares the \
squared amplitudes with CalcHEP and MadGraph at 1000 phase-space points each. \
The complete reports and random seeds remain in the Export variable.",
            "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5mMhhhExport = \
WriteSPINASProcess[\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \"mmbarhhh\"}],\n \
 {\"m\", \"M\"} -> {\"h\", \"h\", \"h\"},\n  {\n    {sm5mMhhhParticles, \
sm5mMhhhAmplitude}\n  }, sm,\n  \"ProcessName\" -> \"sm5mmbarhhh\", Sequence \
@@ validationOptions];\nIf[AssociationQ[sm5mMhhhExport], \
sm5mMhhhExport[\"Directory\"], sm5mMhhhExport]", "Input", CellTags ->
                "sm5-export-sm5f_c12ab07caf13"], Cell[BoxData[TagBox[
                 TagBox[DynamicModuleBox[
                   {TypeSystem`NestedGrid`PackagePrivate`$state$$ =
                     <|"InitialData" -> {<|"Reference" -> "CalcHEP",
