           Cell["After the amplitudes above complete, run this export. One \
C++ process contains the helicity family. It builds SPINAS and compares the \
squared amplitudes with CalcHEP and MadGraph at 1000 phase-space points each. \
The complete reports and random seeds remain in the Export variable.",
            "Text"], Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["sm5eEmMhExport = \
WriteSPINASProcess[\n  FileNameJoin[{spinasOutputDirectory, \
\"eebarmmbarh\"}],\n  {\"e\", \"E\"} -> {\"M\", \"m\", \"h\"},\n  {\n    \
{sm5eEmMhParticles, sm5eEmMhAmplitude}\n  }, sm,\n  \"ProcessName\" -> \
\"sm5eebarmmbarh\", Sequence @@ \
validationOptions];\nIf[AssociationQ[sm5eEmMhExport], \
sm5eEmMhExport[\"Directory\"], sm5eEmMhExport]", "Input", CellTags ->
